# AI-detection layer

`docx_builder init` scaffolds this directory but ships **no** detector scripts:
the drivers are project-specific and depend on a browser plus network access,
so you bring your own.

Drop your AI-detection drivers here. The conventional layout is:

```
tools/ai-detection/
  check.sh                entry point: run the prose through every detector
  run_all_detectors.py    orchestrator
  common/                 shared driver base, trace cleanup, consent handling
  detectors/              one folder per detector
```

Write each detector's output to `report/ai-check/` so it sits alongside the build.

## Prereqs

`uv` and `claude-code`, plus a Chrome or Chromium with remote debugging enabled
and network access to the detection services. These run only when you invoke them.
